{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"十有七年春正月丙辰，公會齊侯、紀侯盟于黃。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"二月丙午，公會邾儀父，盟于趡。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"夏五月丙午，及齊師戰于奚。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"六月丁丑，蔡侯封人卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"秋八月，蔡季自陳歸于蔡。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"癸巳，葬蔡桓侯。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"及宋人、衛人伐邾。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"冬十月朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"十七年春，盟于黃，平齊、紀，且謀衛故也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"乃邾儀父盟于趡，尋蔑之盟也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"夏，及齊師戰于奚，疆事也。於是齊人侵魯疆，疆吏來告，公曰：「疆場之事，慎守其一，而備其不虞。姑盡所備焉。事至而戰，又何謁焉？」","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"蔡桓侯卒。蔡人召蔡季于陳。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"秋，蔡季自陳歸于蔡，蔡人嘉之也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"伐邾，宋志也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"冬十月朔，日有食之。不書日，官失之也。天子有日官，諸侯有日御。日官居卿以厎日，禮也。日御不失日，以授百官于朝。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_28_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_28","textTraditional":"初，鄭伯將以高渠彌為卿，昭公惡之，固諫，不聽，昭公立，懼其殺己也。辛卯，弒昭公，而立公子亹。君子謂「昭公知所惡矣」。公子達曰：「高伯其為戮乎？復惡已甚矣。」","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}